# ── The card corpus (never committed) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# data/ holds the harvested card database, ~700 MB of card art, the raw API
# payloads, and live user data (accounts, saved games, bug reports, custom decks).
# The card data and images are the publisher's intellectual property and are not
# redistributed — the pipeline in scripts/ rebuilds them locally. See README.md.
data/

# NOT ignored, deliberately: tests/fixtures/swu_fixture.db — a few hundred card
# definitions (text and stats only, no artwork, no raw API payloads) built by
# scripts/make_fixture_db.py so that `git clone && pytest` runs the engine,
# keyword, web and regression tiers for real instead of skipping them. A test
# fixture, not the corpus; see that script's docstring for the reasoning.

# Python
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Node / frontend
node_modules/
web/dist/

# ── Local artifacts (regenerable; noisy in review) ────────────────────────────
# Soak-campaign failure bundles, written by scripts/soak.py on an invariant break.
failures/
# QA screenshots and Playwright output. A curated few live in docs/images/.
web/screenshots/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
# Generated by scripts/find_reprints.py.
docs/reprints_worklist.json

# ── Third-party documents (not ours to redistribute) ──────────────────────────
# The official Comprehensive Rules PDF; download it from
# https://starwarsunlimited.com/rules and keep it here locally.
docs/*.pdf

# Logs
*.log

# Agent/editor local state
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/*.bak-*

# OS / editor / shell cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.lnk
.vscode/
.idea/
*.tmp
